  "rationale": "D1 of the blend spec for inverse flames, data-informed (not zero-shot): the second-generation clocks (acme_inverse.wsp2 D1) and the fourth-generation candidate (acme_inverse.wsp3 D1) with equal weights. The members share the self-extinction law of the lean flames and differ in the burner limit, the weak class and the stops; the mean of two forecasts is never scored worse than the mean of their scores. Written after the author saw the aggregate validation scores of both members; the weights are equal, the choice one makes knowing nothing, and no other pair was tried. No number of either member was changed: the member values are copied from the two releases by tools/wsp/blend_edits.py, which chooses nothing. No fit, no search.",
